title: "OpenVLHarness"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
url: "https://openvlharness.github.io/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/uclanlp/OpenVLHarness"
abstract: >-
  A training-free harness that gives multimodal language models nine tool
  capabilities and a per-question multimodal memory, together with the
  evaluation code for the paper's 22 benchmarks.
keywords:
  - multimodal large language models
  - tool use
  - agents
  - multimodal memory
